omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SvjZHvvLwK8Q7kNvwGroXpc&_nc_oc=Adqe13BzW2LIhXiYgCZbuOIhLtZ-TAdh_LsRMvRqJKDjrlx4D28tnxPCoarvJ7WH01w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2j6zAGaPJBCBOvtdk-VWBf-C24wIUnw7CZ8hnj5nrLxQ&oe=69F8B9B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fY5rSpw-KB4Q7kNvwFG-1Mp&_nc_oc=AdpTUoYoXgs9rbjttmM13xbdlrw2hwVZ2vfyF54lchTewfwgogiPK0MtDR5IWXgiMco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0mUFHW6i8DwuO-N38i6EoOc9vPG7aHGhPq7OIWtrXV0A&oe=69F8BB16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zBmA2jZn1WsQ7kNvwHg1UjM&_nc_oc=AdpIFQSkEvpBUuSrPkuRD_U5A5UfLPKF0ztqAFhz5tQD-dAFy3e8gik4HF8knZRboro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0A3x3hS9aGg4BmMrEyR_3AHhN7cjxQIGUZwJjTWkPM-A&oe=69F897F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://